// One soil electrode: a single exposed copper pad on the stake, ENIG finish. It is a
// one-pad part because exposed copper artwork has no net (SPEC.md, "Board shape and
// layout notes"). Pad 8 mm x 8 mm, mask opening the same size; the four pads sit on
// a 20 mm pitch. There is no orderable part: the pad is board copper.
// Footprint: none yet; a project footprint with one 8 x 8 mm SMD pad and a matching
// mask opening is still to be drawn.
part ELECTRODE_PAD_8MM {
    category = "electrode.pad";
    assembled = false;
    pin E { number = "1"; domains = "analog"; directions = "passive"; }
}
